Are you preparing for an Ansible interview? Here are 𝟑𝟎 𝙨𝙘𝙚𝙣𝙖𝙧𝙞𝙤-𝙗𝙖𝙨𝙚𝙙 𝙦𝙪𝙚𝙨𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣𝙨 to help you prepare:

